Your goal is -15 AC, MR, reflection and poison resistance.
That should get you an excellent chance to accumulate the
rest of your AK. It is more difficult for a wizard since you
don't want to wear mithril. Sac for magicbane at your first
opportunity, Elbereth is your friend. Don't be reluctant to
use that /oDig or /oLightning in the meantime.

You need money for more protection. The dungeon sounds will
tell you which levels have vaults. You need to go do
Sokoban. You need another pet for now. A small shield won't
hurt the spell casting much. Ditch the quarterstaff and get
a collection of daggers to throw. Test every piece of non
metal armor until each piece is at least +3.

ID the glass wand, if it's cancellation, you can uncurse
(and, yikes, strip any enchantment or charges) much of your
inventory at once along with maybe blanking some scrolls and
potions. Cancellation won't hurt the +0 [HoB, =oSD or "oMB,
for example, but don't use it on the +1 =oID (a good one to
wear once uncursed).

Wizards have an excellent chance of writing unknown scrolls.

